sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Manager as /manager<br/>Controller-Runtime
    participant AuthCtrl as Auth Service Controller
    participant GwCtrl as Gateway Service Controller
    participant Istio as Istio Service Mesh
    participant OSRoute as OpenShift Router

    Note over Admin,OSRoute: Admission & Webhook Flow
    Admin->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply DataScienceCluster CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-datasciencecluster-v2<br/>TLS (service-ca cert)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated CR (defaults applied)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-datasciencecluster-v2<br/>TLS (service-ca cert)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>Admin: CR Created/Rejected

    Note over Admin,OSRoute: Controller Reconciliation Loop
    K8sAPI->>Manager: Watch event: DataScienceCluster changed
    Manager->>Manager: DAG-based controller dispatch
    Manager->>K8sAPI: List/Get component CRDs<br/>(DataSciencePipelines, Kueue, Ray, TrustyAI)
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Apply manifests (Deployments,<br/>Services, ConfigMaps, RBAC)
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Resource status updates

    Note over Admin,OSRoute: Auth & RBAC Propagation
    K8sAPI->>AuthCtrl: Watch event: Namespace created<br/>(models-as-a-service or kuadrant-system)
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ClusterRoles<br/>(data-science-admingroup-role)
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RoleBindings<br/>(admin & allowed groups)
    K8sAPI-->>AuthCtrl: RBAC resources applied

    Note over Admin,OSRoute: Gateway Ingress Chain
    K8sAPI->>GwCtrl: Watch event: GatewayConfig CR changed
    GwCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Gateway API Resources
    GwCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create kube-auth-proxy Deployment<br/>(with OIDC support)
    GwCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoutes
    GwCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create OpenShift Routes
    GwCtrl->>Istio: Create EnvoyFilters
    GwCtrl->>Istio: Create DestinationRules
    GwCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicies

    Note over Admin,OSRoute: Metrics & Health
    K8sAPI->>Manager: GET :8081/healthz (liveness)<br/>Unauthenticated
    Manager-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
    K8sAPI->>Manager: GET :8081/readyz (readiness)<br/>Unauthenticated
    Manager-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
    K8sAPI->>Manager: GET :8443/metrics<br/>TLS + RBAC auth
    Manager-->>K8sAPI: Prometheus metrics

    Note over Admin,OSRoute: TLS Profile Change
    K8sAPI->>Manager: Watch: APIServer TLS profile changed
    Manager->>Manager: SecurityProfileWatcher cancels context
    Manager->>Manager: Pod restart with new cipher suites
